@startuml memory_flow

header Memory Process Flow - Chatboton
footer Confidential - AI Memory Architecture

title Memory Process: Short-Term to Long-Term Pipeline

actor User
participant "Chatboton Agent" as Agent
participant "Backend Logic" as Backend
participant "Short-Term Memory Logic" as STLogic
database "Qdrant\n(short_term collection)" as STDB

box "Background Pipeline (runs continually)" #LightBlue
    participant "memory_pipeline_loop" as Pipeline
    participant "Memory Transformer Agent" as Processor
end box

database "Qdrant\n(long_term collection)" as LTDB
participant "OpenSearch\n(long_term_memories)" as OSDN
participant "Reranker Agent" as Reranker
database "Neo4j\n(Graph RAG)" as GraphDB #Yellow

== Interaction Phase ==

User -> Backend: Sends message
activate Backend
Backend -> STLogic: Automatic commit_short_term_memory(message)
activate STLogic
STLogic -> STLogic: Generate Embeddings\n(nomic-embed-text)
STLogic -> STDB: Insert Vector + Payload
STDB --> STLogic: Success
STLogic --> Backend: Confirmed
deactivate STLogic

Backend -> Agent: Process request
activate Agent
Agent -> Agent: search_long_term_memory(query)
activate Agent
Agent -> LTDB: Vector Search (Qdrant)
LTDB --> Agent: Vectors hits
Agent -> OSDN: BM25 Search (OpenSearch)
OSDN --> Agent: Text hits
Agent -> Reranker: Re-rank results
activate Reranker
Reranker --> Agent: Sorted list of memories (JSON)
deactivate Reranker
deactivate Agent
Agent --> Backend: Agent Response
deactivate Agent

Backend -> User: Respond to user
deactivate Backend

== Memory Processing Phase (Background) ==

loop every 1 minute
    Pipeline -> STDB: Fetch ONE memory (scroll)
    activate Pipeline
    Pipeline -> Processor: Analyze and transform memory (JSON)
    activate Processor
    note right of Processor: Decide if memory is worthy\nof long-term storage (include: true)\nand extract statement
    Processor --> Pipeline: JSON {include: bool, memory: str}
    deactivate Processor
    
    alt JSON field include is true
        Pipeline -> Pipeline: Generate Embeddings\n(nomic-embed-text)
        Pipeline -> LTDB: Store in long_term collection
        Pipeline -> OSDN: Store in long_term_memories index
        note right of LTDB: Vector similarity search\nused by search_long_term_memory
    end
    Pipeline -> STDB: Delete from short_term
    deactivate Pipeline
end

== Future Enhancements ==

note over STLogic, GraphDB
  **Future Roadmap:**
  * **Short-Term Logic**: Will produce nodes and embed them in Qdrant specific collections.
  * **search_long_term_memory**: Will utilize Graph RAG (Neo4j) alongside Vector Search for deeper context.
end note

STLogic -[dashed]-> GraphDB : [Future] Produce Nodes
Agent -[dashed]-> GraphDB : [Future] Graph RAG Query

@enduml
